---
layout: layouts/base.njk
preloadHero: hero-wrist
heroSlides:
  - img: hero-wrist
    alt: 木のテーブルの上、MODIGIの黒い本革バンドを着けたApple Watchとコーヒー
  - img: atelier-lineup
    alt: 工房の作業台に並ぶ、手縫いを終えたカラフルなレザーバンド
  - img: croco-life
    alt: クロコダイルレザーバンドを着けて手帳に書き込む手元
cards:
  - crocodile/onyx-black
  - crocodile/cognac-camel
  - swift/black
  - swift/orange-mint
  - epsom/taupe
  - epsom/golden-brown
  - swift/black-orange
  - essential/black
---
<section class="hero" data-hero>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero__frame">
      <div class="hero__slides">
        {%- for s in heroSlides %}
        <div class="hero__slide{% if loop.first %} is-active{% endif %}" data-slide>
          {% img s.img, s.alt, "(min-width: 1440px) 1296px, 100vw", ("eager" if loop.first else "lazy") %}
        </div>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="hero__content">
        <h1 class="hero__title">
          <span class="line"><span>Crafted for your wrist.</span></span>
          <span class="line line--sub"><span>Discover handmade leather bands</span></span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero__ja hero__fade">あなたの<span class="nw">Apple Watch</span>に、上質な一本を。</p>
        <div class="btn-row hero__fade">
          <a class="btn btn--gold" href="/collection/">コレクションを見る</a>
          <a class="btn btn--outline-light" href="{{ site.amazon }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-amazon="hero">Amazon公式ストア</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__dots" role="group" aria-label="スライド">
        {%- for s in heroSlides %}<button type="button" aria-label="スライド {{ loop.index }}"{% if loop.first %} aria-current="true"{% endif %} data-dot></button>{% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tight">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="heading-row reveal">
      <h2 class="title-caps">The Collection</h2>
      <a class="link-arrow" href="/collection/">すべて見る</a>
    </div>
    <div class="cards">
      {%- for key in cards %}
      {%- set c = variants | variantBy(key) %}
      {%- set ln = lines | lineBy(c.line) %}
      <a class="card reveal" style="--d:{{ (loop.index0 % 4) * 0.06 }}s" href="{{ c.url }}">
        <div class="card__img">{% img "v/" + c.images[0], ln.ja + " " + c.ja, "(min-width: 1100px) 25vw, (min-width: 640px) 50vw, 100vw" %}</div>
        <div class="card__body">
          <h3 class="card__title">{{ ln.en }} {{ c.en }}</h3>
          <p class="card__desc">{{ ln.ja }} ／ {{ c.ja }}</p>
          {% if c.price %}<p class="card__price">{{ c.price | yen }}</p>{% endif %}
        </div>
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--panel" id="reviews">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="heading-row reveal">
      <h2 class="title-caps">Customer Voices</h2>
      <span class="muted" style="font-size:15px">お客様の声</span>
    </div>
    {% set list = reviews %}{% set showSummary = true %}{% include "partials/reviews.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" data-parallax>
  <div class="band__media" data-parallax-media>{% img "atelier-stitching", "職人が木製のクランプにレザーを挟み、二本の針で手縫いする様子", "100vw" %}</div>
  <blockquote class="reveal" style="margin:0">
    <p class="band__eyebrow">Hand-stitched in Vietnam</p>
    <p class="band__quote">一針ずつ、想いを縫い込む。</p>
  </blockquote>
</section>

<section class="section atelier">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head section-head--center reveal">
      <h2 class="title-caps">The Atelier</h2>
      <p class="h2" style="margin-top:16px">一本が仕上がるまで。</p>
      <p class="lead">ベトナムの工房で、職人がひとつずつ。機械任せにしない四つの工程が、MODIGIの品質をつくります。</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="step reveal">
        <div class="step__img">{% img "atelier-cutting", "職人が一枚革に包丁を入れ、パーツを裁断する様子", "(min-width: 1100px) 25vw, (min-width: 640px) 50vw, 85vw" %}</div>
        <span class="step__num">01</span>
        <h3 class="step__title">Select &amp; Cut</h3>
        <p class="step__ja">革を選び、裁つ</p>
        <p class="step__text">一枚革の表情を見極め、キズのない部位だけを選んで手作業で裁断します。</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step reveal" style="--d:.08s">
        <div class="step__img">{% img "atelier-pricking", "菱目打ちを木槌で打ち、縫い穴をあける様子", "(min-width: 1100px) 25vw, (min-width: 640px) 50vw, 85vw" %}</div>
        <span class="step__num">02</span>
        <h3 class="step__title">Pricking</h3>
        <p class="step__ja">菱目を打つ</p>
        <p class="step__text">菱目打ちを木槌で一打ずつ。等間隔の縫い穴が、美しいステッチの土台になります。</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step reveal" style="--d:.16s">
        <div class="step__img">{% img "atelier-stitching", "木製クランプに革を挟み、二本の針で手縫いする様子", "(min-width: 1100px) 25vw, (min-width: 640px) 50vw, 85vw" %}</div>
        <span class="step__num">03</span>
        <h3 class="step__title">Hand-stitching</h3>
        <p class="step__ja">一針ずつ縫う</p>
        <p class="step__text">二本の針で交互に縫い上げるサドルステッチ。ほつれにくく、長く使える仕立てです。</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step reveal" style="--d:.24s">
        <div class="step__img">{% img "atelier-crease", "熱したネン引きでレザーの縁に線を入れる様子", "(min-width: 1100px) 25vw, (min-width: 640px) 50vw, 85vw" %}</div>
        <span class="step__num">04</span>
        <h3 class="step__title">Edge Finishing</h3>
        <p class="step__ja">コバを仕上げる</p>
        <p class="step__text">熱したコテで縁を引き締め、何度も磨いて、なめらかで艶のあるコバに仕上げます。</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head section-head--center reveal">
      <h2 class="title-caps">The MODIGI Way</h2>
      <p class="lead">見えない部分にこそ、手間を惜しまない。表革の選定から裁断、手縫い、コバ磨きまで、ひとつずつ人の手で。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="features">
      <div class="feature reveal">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 38 38 10M30 10h8v8"/><path d="M14 30l-4-4M20 24l-4-4M26 18l-4-4"/></svg>
        <h3 class="feature__title">Hand-stitched</h3>
        <p class="feature__ja">職人による手縫い</p>
        <p>強度の高い縫い糸で一針ずつ。ほつれにくく、ステッチそのものが美しい表情に。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature reveal" style="--d:.08s">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 8c8 4 16 4 24 0v32c-8 4-16 4-24 0z"/><path d="M18 16h12M18 24h12M18 32h12"/></svg>
        <h3 class="feature__title">Fine Leather</h3>
        <p class="feature__ja">選び抜いた本革</p>
        <p>フランス産カーフやクロコダイルを厳選。裏地には防水加工のカーフを合わせて快適に。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature reveal" style="--d:.16s">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="15" y="12" width="18" height="24" rx="5"/><path d="M19 12V5h10v7M19 36v7h10v-7"/></svg>
        <h3 class="feature__title">Every Size</h3>
        <p class="feature__ja">全モデル・全サイズ対応</p>
        <p>Series 4〜12、SE、Ultra 1〜4まで。38〜49mmのすべてに対応し、工具不要で付け替え。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature reveal" style="--d:.24s">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="7" y="18" width="34" height="22" rx="1"/><path d="M7 26h34M24 18v22M24 18c-4-8-14-8-10-2 2 3 10 2 10 2 0 0 8 1 10-2 4-6-6-6-10 2"/></svg>
        <h3 class="feature__title">Gift Ready</h3>
        <p class="feature__ja">ギフトボックス入り</p>
        <p>オリジナルのギフトボックスでお届け。誕生日や記念日の贈り物にそのまま。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--panel">
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="split__media split__media--tall reveal-img">{% img "atelier-finish", "工房の作業台で、コバ仕上げを待つ色とりどりのレザーバンド", "(min-width: 960px) 50vw, 100vw" %}</div>
    <div>
      <h2 class="title-caps reveal">Since {{ site.founded }}</h2>
      <p class="h2 reveal" style="margin-top:20px">ベトナムの工房から、<br>あなたの手首へ。</p>
      <p class="lead reveal" style="margin-top:28px">MODIGIは、ベトナムに受け継がれてきた革の手仕事に魅せられ、{{ site.founded }}年に生まれました。大量生産では決して生まれない、ひとつひとつ表情の異なる一本を。職人の技と誇りを、あなたの日常へ。</p>
      <div class="stats reveal">
        <div><div class="stat__num">{{ site.founded }}</div><div class="stat__label">創業</div></div>
        <div><div class="stat__num">100%</div><div class="stat__label">手縫い仕上げ</div></div>
        <div><div class="stat__num">38–49</div><div class="stat__label">mm 全サイズ対応</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-row reveal"><a class="btn btn--outline-light" href="/story/">ブランドストーリー</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="heading-row reveal">
      <h2 class="title-caps">Materials</h2>
      <a class="link-arrow" href="/materials/">素材とお手入れ</a>
    </div>
    <div class="materials">
      <a class="material reveal" href="/collection/swift/">
        <span class="material__swatch" style="background:#e07134"></span>
        <span class="material__en">Veau Swift</span><span class="material__ja">ヴォー・スイフト</span>
        <p>きめ細かくマット。吸い付くようにしなやかなフランス産カーフ。</p>
      </a>
      <a class="material reveal" style="--d:.08s" href="/collection/epsom/">
        <span class="material__swatch" style="background:#8c8172"></span>
        <span class="material__en">Veau Epsom</span><span class="material__ja">ヴォー・エプソン</span>
        <p>細かな型押しで軽く、傷や水に強い。端正なシルエットを保つ。</p>
      </a>
      <a class="material reveal" style="--d:.16s" href="/collection/crocodile/">
        <span class="material__swatch" style="background:#0e0d0c"></span>
        <span class="material__en">Crocodile</span><span class="material__ja">クロコダイル</span>
        <p>腹部の均整なスクエアグレイン。静かな艶をまとう最上位素材。</p>
      </a>
      <a class="material reveal" style="--d:.24s" href="/materials/#barenia">
        <span class="material__swatch" style="background:#a9733f"></span>
        <span class="material__en">Barenia</span><span class="material__ja">バレニア</span>
        <p>使うほどに深い飴色へ。経年変化を最も楽しめる、育てる革。</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% if collections.journal.length %}
<section class="section section--panel">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="heading-row reveal">
      <h2 class="title-caps">Journal</h2>
      <a class="link-arrow" href="/journal/">すべての記事</a>
    </div>
    <div class="posts">
      {%- for post in collections.journal | head(3) %}
      {% include "partials/post-card.njk" %}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="section sns" id="sns">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head section-head--center reveal">
      <h2 class="title-caps">MODIGI in SNS</h2>
      <p class="h2" style="margin-top:16px">工房の日常を、毎日発信中。</p>
      <p class="lead">新作カラー、職人の手仕事、着用イメージ。MODIGIの「いま」をSNSでお届けしています。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sns__grid">
      {%- for s in site.sns %}
      <a class="sns-card sns-card--{{ s.id }} reveal" style="--d:{{ loop.index0 * 0.08 }}s" href="{{ s.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <span class="sns-card__icon">{% include "partials/sns-icon.njk" %}</span>
        <span class="sns-card__name">{{ s.name }}</span>
        <span class="sns-card__handle">{{ s.handle }}</span>
        <span class="sns-card__text">{{ s.ja }}</span>
        <span class="sns-card__cta">{% if s.id == 'youtube' %}チャンネル登録{% else %}フォローする{% endif %}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17 17 7M9 7h8v8"/></svg></span>
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
